                        "entry_id": "28a1d4cc-7061-366f-86b0-c994ff8f3747",
                        "glosses": [
                            "weibliche Person, die durch ihr philosophisches Denken bekannt geworden ist; ein denkender Mensch"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "db44151a-4004-4559-928a-8f063eb2f8ef",
                                "sense_id": "4cf31965-3709-32a4-8e0d-f7c0e7d2fd0f",
                                "text": "Es hat nie viele Denkerinnen gegeben."
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "aa0fd0a0-d089-4d27-b610-b030fa5d8fbf",
                        "source_entry_id": "28a1d4cc-7061-366f-86b0-c994ff8f3747",
                        "source_sense_id": "4cf31965-3709-32a4-8e0d-f7c0e7d2fd0f",
                        "source_sense_description": "weibliche Person, die durch ihr philosophisches Denken bekannt geworden ist; ein denkender Mensch",
                        "target_lang_word": "thinker",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "thinker",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "345d417f-39ec-3705-8902-7b8c33a9772b",
                                        "entry_id": "eaa31f22-b9ae-3090-b35f-1f9b1dadba91",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One who spends time thinking, contemplating or meditating."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6cb717db-15f1-40d2-bc20-cafb8ac682c2",
                                                "sense_id": "345d417f-39ec-3705-8902-7b8c33a9772b",
                                                "text": "The doer and the thinker\nNo allowance for the other."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "38451ac6-0c2b-3577-b87e-9dde50ea89f4",
                                        "entry_id": "eaa31f22-b9ae-3090-b35f-1f9b1dadba91",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An intellectual, such as a philosopher or theologian."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3802edc1-1815-4a0c-9bd8-c60a9cb5f5cd",
                                                "sense_id": "38451ac6-0c2b-3577-b87e-9dde50ea89f4",
                                                "text": "From his studies of these thinkers and activists, Mr. Obama took what he called the “Niebuhrian” lesson that we can have “a cleareyed view of the world and the realities of cruelty and sin and greed and violence, and yet, still maintain a sense of hope and possibility, as an act of will and leap of faith.”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4063965c-05d9-3ebd-8ce9-a70518485850",
                                        "entry_id": "eaa31f22-b9ae-3090-b35f-1f9b1dadba91",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The brain; the mind."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "28a1f741-fc6e-4a62-b275-de0dc097f36c",
                                                "sense_id": "4063965c-05d9-3ebd-8ce9-a70518485850",
                                                "text": "\"Well, I tried to do like you and grandfather say; don't use my thinker, use imagination.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2702660b-1252-3513-b2ff-f45f3c396684",
                                        "entry_id": "eaa31f22-b9ae-3090-b35f-1f9b1dadba91",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A poser; a conundrum that requires some thinking."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c92b569b-bfe3-4028-ac4a-4b2d2347fc68",
                                                "sense_id": "2702660b-1252-3513-b2ff-f45f3c396684",
                                                "text": "HANK: The NRA is a Washington D.C. based organization. Are you telling me you support Washington D.C.?\nDALE: That's a thinker."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c656ffce-f480-4c61-ba9e-7a5e63b314e7",
                        "source_entry_id": "28a1d4cc-7061-366f-86b0-c994ff8f3747",
                        "source_sense_id": "4cf31965-3709-32a4-8e0d-f7c0e7d2fd0f",
                        "source_sense_description": "weibliche Person, die durch ihr philosophisches Denken bekannt geworden ist; ein denkender Mensch",
                        "target_lang_word": "philosopher",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "philosopher",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dcaf9c7d-bb82-398f-b6e3-3552e9463a94",
                                        "entry_id": "d1500181-4ccc-3a95-913f-5fd8219ac268",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A lover of wisdom."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "310b7afb-a173-35b0-9713-213ffc49e810",
                                        "entry_id": "d1500181-4ccc-3a95-913f-5fd8219ac268",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A student of philosophy."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b91244a1-f7ee-35d3-a3ed-bbb93ccc6c49",
                                        "entry_id": "d1500181-4ccc-3a95-913f-5fd8219ac268",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A scholar or expert engaged in or contributing to philosophical inquiry."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "27a49476-8143-475f-9bc3-9d67b02fa985",
                                                "sense_id": "b91244a1-f7ee-35d3-a3ed-bbb93ccc6c49",
                                                "text": "Their playwrights knew better. Scandal, murder, hair-rending and railing against the gods sold tickets. King is not a philosopher. He knows how to sell tickets."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c51b3215-74b8-39d5-95ed-084b419cc65d",
                                        "entry_id": "d1500181-4ccc-3a95-913f-5fd8219ac268",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person who applies the principles of philosophy to the conduct of their life, as by acting calmly and rationally in the face of inevitable change."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "archaic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5266ec96-b98b-4282-b665-6214a24534d4",
                                                "sense_id": "c51b3215-74b8-39d5-95ed-084b419cc65d",
                                                "text": "Then certaine Philosophers of the Epicureans, and of the Stoikes, encountred him"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9a5cfb3a-e7e7-4ec8-ab99-00d24b2160d7",
                                                "sense_id": "c51b3215-74b8-39d5-95ed-084b419cc65d",
                                                "text": "This is not the sort of happiness which a man would in general wish to owe to his wife; but where other powers of entertainment are wanting, the true philosopher will derive benefit from such as are given."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b56247ef-3b10-3f29-80be-59afa3721d48",
                                        "entry_id": "d1500181-4ccc-3a95-913f-5fd8219ac268",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A student, scholar, or expert in any branch of knowledge, especially those branches studied prior to being considered part of pure science."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "archaic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "93e29504-ebd6-313c-bd01-b13e05abefd3",
                                        "entry_id": "d1500181-4ccc-3a95-913f-5fd8219ac268",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An alchemist."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "395de0f2-d087-4bcc-811c-75bf294c038d",
                                                "sense_id": "93e29504-ebd6-313c-bd01-b13e05abefd3",
                                                "text": "Then thus conclude I, since that God of heaven\nWill not that these philosophers neven\nHow that a man shall come unto this stone,\nI rede as for the best to let it gon."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6a429d0a-aaee-4d1f-85d6-605406600ae6",
                                                "sense_id": "93e29504-ebd6-313c-bd01-b13e05abefd3",
                                                "text": "No further progress was made in this science until the Mohammedan alchemists embarked upon their search for the philosopher's stone, the elixir of life, and a method of transmuting base metals into gold."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b871a2f0-b1a6-44b7-afd4-e045f85417d3",
                        "source_entry_id": "28a1d4cc-7061-366f-86b0-c994ff8f3747",
                        "source_sense_id": "4cf31965-3709-32a4-8e0d-f7c0e7d2fd0f",
                        "source_sense_description": "weibliche Person, die durch ihr philosophisches Denken bekannt geworden ist; ein denkender Mensch",
